关键史料：《三国志·[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "傅嘏", "cat": "people"}]傅嘏[/url][/color]传》："百官群司，军国通任，随时之宜，以应政机。"——说明军政合一的灵活特征不是例外，而是建安年间的常态。


[b][font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/26.tres]军事参谋体系（核心创新）[/font][/b]


曹操在司空府内创设的军事参谋制度，打破了传统"朝议—执行"的决策流程，形成"幕府密议—直接执行"模式：


[b]军师（最高级）[/b]


[indent]•  早期唯一：[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "荀攸", "cat": "people"}]荀攸[/url][/color]（常谋谟帷幄）[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  后期扩增：中军师荀攸、前军师[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "钟繇", "cat": "people"}]钟繇[/url][/color]、左军师[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "凉茂", "cat": "people"}]凉茂[/url][/color]、右军师毛玠[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  《通典》："军国选举及刑狱法制皆使决焉"——涉及人事与法律，综合决策辅助职位[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]


[b]军师祭酒（建安三年，198年设立）[/b]


[indent]•  由曹操为郭嘉特辟此职，无定员，便于广纳人才[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  兼具：战略咨询 + 机要秘书[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  [color=#000000]完整任职者：[/color] [color=#0066FF][url={"research": "董昭", "cat": "people"}]董昭[/url][/color]、薛洪、董蒙、王选、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "袁涣", "cat": "people"}]袁涣[/url][/color]、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "王朗", "cat": "people"}]王朗[/url][/color]、任籓、杜袭、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "王粲", "cat": "people"}]王粲[/url][/color]、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "傅巽", "cat": "people"}]傅巽[/url][/color]、张承、郭嘉、张京、李义、杜夔、董芬[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
