[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  避讳注：陈寿避[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "司马师", "cat": "people"}]司马师[/url][/color]讳，写作"军祭酒"或"司空军祭酒"[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]


[b]军谋掾（储备层）[/b]


[indent]•  资历低于军师/军师祭酒[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  [color=#000000]已知担任者：[/color] [color=#0066FF][url={"research": "徐邈", "cat": "people"}]徐邈[/url][/color]、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "田豫", "cat": "people"}]田豫[/url][/color]、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "牵招", "cat": "people"}]牵招[/url][/color]、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "高堂隆", "cat": "people"}]高堂隆[/url][/color]、贾洪、薛夏、隗禧、韩宣、令狐邵、荀纬、沐并；军议掾高堂隆[/indent]
